# Data Directory

This folder contains supporting data artifacts used during model inference and explainability.

## Files

### `lime_background_data.joblib`

A background data for generating local explanations using LIME.

* Helps simulate realistic feature distributions
* Enables perturbation-based explanations
* Used only for interpretability (not for prediction)

---

### `feature_names.joblib`

Stores feature names used during model interpretation.

* Primarily used for mapping model inputs to human-readable explanations
* Not required for prediction (handled internally by the pipeline)

---


